      "repair_reason": "- [P2] The remaining action is maintainer protocol-shape approval and normal CI resolution, not a narrow automated code repair.; Cleared: The diff adds a protocol schema field, generated Swift model entries, tests, and lint-only cleanups; I found no new dependency, workflow, secret-handling, or code-execution surface. (sha=cd02be67e4230ea43ca9ba23d7f94cccfdfff3cb)",
      "review_summary": "The PR adds an optional root `paperclip` field to the Gateway `agent` params schema, mirrors it in the generated Swift model, adds validator regression coverage, and carries two lint-only gateway cleanups.\n\nPR surface: Source +5, Tests +28, Other +4. Total +37 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-level: current main validates `agent` params against a closed `AgentParamsSchema` that lacks `paperclip`, and the gateway handler rejects invalid params before dispatch. I did not run a live Paperclip deployment in this read-only review.",
      "review_followup": "- [P2] The remaining action is maintainer protocol-shape approval and normal CI resolution, not a narrow automated code repair.",
